During the 1962–63 Scottish football season, [[Celtic F.C.|Celtic]] competed in [[Scottish Division One]].

Celtic reached the [[1962–63 Scottish Cup|Scottish Cup]] final, where they were defeated by [[Rangers F.C.|Rangers]].<ref>{{cite news|url=https://www.newspapers.com/article/daily-record/158314528/|title=Celtic lost it all up front|work=[[Daily Record (Scotland)|Daily Record]]|date=16 May 1963|access-date=2 November 2024|page=19|via=[[Newspapers.com]]}}</ref> The club also reached the final of the [[Glasgow Cup]], where they lost to [[Third Lanark A.C.|Third Lanark]].<ref>{{cite news|url=https://www.newspapers.com/article/daily-record/158314847/|title=Wee Joe is Big Hero for Thirds|first=John|last=McPhail|work=[[Daily Record (Scotland)|Daily Record]]|date=9 April 1963|access-date=2 November 2024|page=18|via=[[Newspapers.com]]}}</ref>

